WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.970
In 1933, Gandhi began a fast of 21 days.

2
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.020
He said his inner voice had told him to.

3
00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.570
The Bhagavad Gita adds a puzzle.

4
00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:16.390
One verse says a Master in the heart
makes our deeds dance to His tune.

5
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:21.670
A few verses later: meditate,
and as thou wilt, then act.

6
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:25.120
So if karma shapes your
life, are you free?

7
00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.920
And can an inner voice guide a Hindu?

8
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:32.820
In this mission, you'll take karma apart
to see what it does and does not fix.

9
00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:37.560
Then you'll find where conscience sits
among the sources Hindus use to know what

10
00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:38.710
is right.

11
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:42.600
Your mission: find out whether
karma leaves room for freedom,

12
00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:44.930
and how far conscience can guide.
